tmp/fixtures/small_1k/
tmp/fixtures/medium_10k/
tmp/fixtures/large_100k/
tmp/fixtures/unicode_names/

## ops_test runtime output directories (created during test runs)
tmp/fixtures/ops_test/copy_dest/
tmp/fixtures/ops_test/sta_verify_dest/

## Everything SDK download artefact (extracted copy is not committed either)
lib/everything-sdk-download/

## OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini

## Secrets / local config
*.local.json
appsettings.local.*

